\" width=\"599\" height=\"399\" srcset=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Mak-Ao-Kao-White-Sand-Beach1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Mak-Ao-Kao-White-Sand-Beach1-768x513.jpg 768w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Mak-Ao-Kao-White-Sand-Beach1-270x180.jpg 270w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Koh-Mak-Ao-Kao-White-Sand-Beach1.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 599px) 100vw, 599px\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">โรงแรม </span>Koh Mak Ao Kao White Sand Beach <span style=\"color: #000000;\">แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว 9.2/10 จาก Booking.com และ 9.1/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้  1-5 ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ  1,361  บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=14875424\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.booking.com/hotel/th/ao-kao-white-sand-beach-resort.en.html?aid=1670294&amp;no_rooms=1&amp;group_adults=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-1891 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Booking-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<hr />\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.booking.com/hotel/th/koh-mak-resort.en.html?aid=1670294&amp;no_rooms